Access Control Architecture
When a user attempts to access content:

User Action
       ↓
API Gateway
       ↓
Authorization Service
       ↓
Realm Validation
       ↓
Access Granted Or Denied
Example:

User Realm = TEEN

Destination Realm = ADULT

Result = DENIED
The client application cannot override this decision.

