The existence of a Teen Environment remains transparent, but individual users are not labeled publicly.

Adult Environment Privacy
Adult users should not be publicly identifiable through age disclosures alone.

The platform therefore avoids displaying:

18+
21+
Adult Verification Badge
Adult Age Category
Adult users receive the same public verification badge.

